  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\n\nThe Main Menu Friend Locations are currently more limiting then the small Friends Wing. The Wing allows you to show every list of Friends you have (Online and Favorites) and allows you to sort by it either by Name, Status and **LOCATION**. This allows me to sort a specific Favorite List of Friends by Location.\n\nThis is currently not possible in the Main Menu, because there you can **only** sort by Location for your entire Friends List using the Friends Location Category.\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nI think the best solution to this would probably be to just ditch the Friends Location category in the Main Menu all together and instead offer Location as a sorting option for Online Friends and for all the different Friend Favorite Lists we have.\n\nDoing this would clear up the UI a bit and allows us for more / better Location sorting, just like we can do in the Wing Menu\n\n# Attachments:\n\nI've linked a few Twitter Threads about this topic for reference:  \n\nhttps://twitter.com/vr_hai/status/1629760656281944066  \n\nhttps://twitter.com/DrBlackRat/status/1629825221828964354",
